v1.0.55 build 70: deferred CupertinoDatePicker build for smooth animation

showSheetDatePicker now wraps CupertinoDatePicker in a stateful
_DeferredDatePickerSheet that defers the heavy picker build by
one frame (addPostFrameCallback). During the first frame, only a
lightweight Container(color: cardBg) is rendered — the slide-up
animation starts at full fps. After that single frame the real
CupertinoDatePicker is swapped in.

Also includes build 69 RepaintBoundary-per-section fix for
manual_booking_modal and build 68 fontFamily consistency fix.
